    "title": "For Sale: Arsenal Yards Goes on the Market, Retail and Residential Properties Available - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Charlie Breitrose ,\n1 days ago Watertown’s major shopping destination, Arsenal Yards, has been put up for sale along with the residential units built in the complex on Arsenal Street. Boylston Properties, owners and developers of Arsenal Yards, declined to comment when contacted by Watertown News, but confirmed the retail and residential portions of the complex on Arsenal Street are up for sale. The Hampton Inn and Suites hotel and the lab/office space are not up for sale. Read full article",
